# Generated by forge build from forge/seed and the checkout's fixes. Do not edit: see docs/FORGE.md, "Fixing a generated guide".
# Tanaris, Un'Goro Crater, Silithus, the Alliance capitals and Eastern Plaguelands, Alliance ~56 to ~58
# (consensus visits 77-86).
# Flow: Ratchet -> fly Gadgetzan (Tanaris errands, Broken Pillar) -> fly Marshal's Refuge
# (Un'Goro: Linken, the tar, ash and wasp hive) -> ride north to Silithus: Cenarion Hold (flight path, bind) ->
# the Dredge and scorpid hunts -> Layo Starstrike and Southwind Village -> hearth Cenarion Hold -> the Hive'Ashi
# tower -> Layo -> fly Ratchet (bind, Liv, the Stone Circle) -> boat to Booty Bay, fly Stormwind -> Ironforge ->
# Southshore, Darrow Hill -> Chillwind Camp, fly Light's Hope Chapel -> Corin's Crossing -> Infiltrator Hameya ->
# Quel'Lithien Lodge -> the Undercroft -> hearth Ratchet.
# Optional: Of Forgotten Memories (5781): Mercutio Filthgorger is an elite in the Undercroft.
# Deviations from the export (smooth flow first):
# - Kalimdor first, then the Eastern Kingdoms, instead of Silithus -> Tanaris -> Redridge -> Swamp of Sorrows ->
#   Stormwind -> Ironforge -> back to Un'Goro -> hearth Ironforge -> Hillsbrad -> Plaguelands -> Ratchet: Tanaris
#   and Un'Goro come before Silithus (one sweep south from Ratchet), Ratchet's turn-ins (4502, 3444) are done on
#   the way to the boat, and the guide ends with a hearth to Ratchet, where the next guide starts.
# - Dropped: the Redridge visit (A Sealed Crate 91899, 91900, 91904, 91905: Forever crates with no known source)
#   and the Swamp of Sorrows visit (Petty Squabbles 2783 turn-in, A Tale of Sorrow 2801, The Stones That Bind Us
#   2681 accept: a long side trip for one small chain). A short grind before the last hearth makes up the level.
# - Binds: Gadgetzan, Stormwind, Ironforge and Light's Hope Chapel binds are dropped (never hearthed to);
#   Cenarion Hold (used in Silithus) and Ratchet (set on the way through, used at the end) are kept.
# - A Little Slime Goes a Long Way (4513) is accepted in Ironforge after the Un'Goro sweep: its jars are filled on
#   the next guide's Un'Goro visit. A Donation of Wool (7791) is optional (cloth).
# - Hameya's Plea (6024, scroll from 05): key and turn-in here. Marauders of Darrowshire
#   (5206): the Scourge Champions in the Noxious Glade, north of the chapel.
# - Train class in Ironforge (level 56 spells); Druids trained in Darnassus in the previous guide.
# - Ironforge from the tram: Bubulo, Laris, Mistina, Archesonus, Rotimer,
#   Jademoon, then the flight master.
# Carried on: Umber, Archivist (6844), Super Sticky (4504), Bungle in the Jungle (4496), The Stone Circle (3444,
# turned in later), Fire Plume Forged (5801), Linken's Memory (3942), Good Luck Charm
# (5050), the cloth donations, Flint Shadowmore (6184), Taking Back Silithus (8275), Return to Chromie (5941),
# A Reliquary of Purity (5527), Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood (5159).
# - Dropped because the next guide never turns them in (no Burning Steppes, Feralas, Searing Gorge or Azshara
#   return): Yuka Screwspigot (4324), Feathermoon Stronghold (7494), Mayara Brightwing (4766), Dwarven Justice
#   (3371), Poisoned Water (6804), The Super Egg-O-Matic (2741); Fragments of the Past (5246, 5247) went with 05's
#   Azshara visit.
guide forever/alliance/50-60/05-silithus
title Silithus, Un'Goro Crater & Eastern Plaguelands
faction Alliance
levels 56-58
zone Silithus
next forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus

# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Human Alliance, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 125.7 h -> 117.5 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
